<title>FINLAND: Finnish Feb export prices fall 5.3 pct yr/yr. [CORRECTED 07:43 GMT]</title>
<headline>Finnish Feb export prices fall 5.3 pct yr/yr. [CORRECTED 07:43 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects fall to 5.3 pct from 0.5 pct in the headline.)</p>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated export prices fell 5.3 percent year-on-year in February and 0.5 percent over January (corrects period of comparison), Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>			Feb 1997	 Jan 1997	Feb 1996</p>
<p> Yr/Yr		-5.3 pct	 -5.4 pct	+5.8 pct</p>
<p> Mth/mth	    -0.5 pct	 -0.1 pct	-0.7 pct</p>
<p>(Import prices:)</p>
<p>			Feb 1997	 Jan 1997	 Feb 1996</p>
<p> Yr/Yr		+1.6 pct	 +2.1 pct	 -0.8 pct</p>
<p> Mth/Mth	    -0.2 pct	 +0.7 pct	 +0.2 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
